---
/**
 * WhoWeAre - Mission and overview section
 */
---

<section id="who-we-are" class="py-20 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-lcs-light-section rounded-lg p-8 sm:p-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-dosis mb-6 text-gray-900">Who We Are</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The Laurier Computing Society is a student-led organization dedicated to fostering a vibrant computing community at Wilfrid Laurier University. We connect students with industry professionals, provide learning opportunities, and create spaces for innovation and collaboration.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Whether you're interested in software development, cybersecurity, data science, or any area of computing, we have something for you. Join us in building the future of technology.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
